# The README demo: the overview, a clone, the list, and live info. VHS writes
# one text frame per command, so live views are sampled with short Sleep
# commands; record.sh checks those frames for layout jumps.
Sleep 600ms
Type "clonetree"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "clonetree new my-feature"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 100ms
